      "review_description": "Best Green Solar installed my solar system. I contacted about 20 or so companies when I first started looking into solar energy to receive quotes. I ran into these individuals during that process. Mahesh, a man who was probably the owner, thoroughly explained everything to me about the solar system, and he provided me with a quote that was at least 20% less expensive than the market. I learned how polite and honest Mahesh and the Best Green Solar firm are when I spoke with other businesses after speaking with Mahesh (some of them tried to trick me). Nobody was even close in competition to Best Green Solar. It was no brainer for me to choose them. They installed it really promptly as well. Even in my dreams, I would recommend them because I am so happy with them!",
